WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.333
Week 6: The Present: Regular Actions. describe habits ask about routines say how often something happens

2
00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:14.047
Mission brief. Compare your weekday schedule with a schedule from another Spanish-speaking community.

3
00:00:14.047 --> 00:00:23.729
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.729 --> 00:00:31.872
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.872 --> 00:00:40.655
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.655 --> 00:01:11.415
Model language. Voy a comparar mi horario con el de un compañero. — I am going to compare my schedule with a coworker's. Le pregunto sobre su rutina diaria. — I ask about their daily routine. Anoto las diferencias entre los dos horarios. — I write down the differences between the two schedules. Encuentro un horario similar al mío. — I find a schedule similar to mine. Respondo sus preguntas sobre mi rutina. — I answer their questions about my routine.

7
00:01:11.415 --> 00:01:21.419
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
